-- Magna Carta (1215), English translation in McKechnie 1905: CHAPTERS 17 TO 19.
-- Where common pleas are held (17) and where, when and by whom the three assizes are held (18, 19).
-- Terms the text does not define, taken as plain facts or typed values (see NOTES.md):
-- common pleas, the King's court, novel disseisin, mort d'ancestor, darrein presentment,
-- county court, justiciar, knights and freeholders, "as many as may be required".
